L["ONBOARD_MANUAL_CONFIRM_TEXT_FOREVER"] = "|cffffd100Confirm manual Forever layout|r\n\nForever cannot report physical monitor boundaries and may not restore a manually resized window reliably after a cold launch. Continue only if you deliberately resized WoW across two displays, or intend to divide one ultrawide.\n\nDo not continue on an ordinary unsplit single monitor. Companion is strongly recommended for recovery and persistence."
